    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Publish duration p50 / p99 by outcome",
      "description": "kernel.outbox.publish.duration, labels outcome (published/retry_scheduled/failed/dead_letter), event_type. One instrument covers success and failure so a single histogram tells you both latency and where messages are going.",
