      "description": "Upper-bound proxy: sum of per-stage p99s (outbox publish + consumer handle + sweeper batch), until a dedicated end-to-end span metric is exported from the propagated outbox traceparent (OBSERVABILITY_DESIGN.md section 2.2). Read this as 'worst case, not typical case' \u2014 a true single-trace measurement will read lower once wired.",
